OL,3,GNEWSAPolice appeal after woman, 22,    
OL,4,Araped in Glasgow park                  
OL,6,FDetectives are appealing for           
OL,7,Finformation after a 22-year-old woman  
OL,8,Fwas raped in Glasgow's Kelvingrove     
OL,9,FPark.                                  
OL,11,FThe woman had been walking through the 
OL,12,Fpark at about 23:50 on Friday when she 
OL,13,Fwas attacked near a bridge from Kelvin 
OL,14,FWalkway.                               
OL,16,FThe suspect is described as being      
OL,17,Fwhite, aged 30-40, about 5ft 10in tall 
OL,18,Fand had a large build. He spoke with an
OL,19,FEnglish accent and was wearing a black 
OL,20,Fhoodie, black trousers and a black face
OL,21,Fcovering.                              
OL,23,APub: 22-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
