OL,3,GNEWSAPolice appeal after woman, 22,    
OL,4,Araped in Glasgow park                  
OL,6,FDet Supt Peter Sharp said: "This was a 
OL,7,Fterrifying experience for the woman and
OL,8,Fextensive inquiries are ongoing to     
OL,9,Ftrace the individual responsible."     
